{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "note": "Hand-curated map from npm/cargo/pip packages to starter-foundry capability IDs. Consumed by scripts/analyze-buildouts.mjs and the capability-inferrer. When an agent installs package X mid-buildout, it's signal we should have attached the mapped capability. Confidence values: 1.0 = unique identifier (e.g. @stripe/stripe-js → saas-billing). 0.5 = strong hint but context-dependent. 0.3 = weak, probably just an incidental dep.",
